### Команда: INTEG PLAN
**Контекст**: @.cursor/rules/integration_developer/mainrule-core.mdc
**Gates**: @.cursor/rules/integration_developer/isolation_rules/_lean/plan.mdc
**Скиллы:**
- @.agents/skills/query-builder/SKILL.md
- @.agents/skills/brainstorming/SKILL.md
- @.agents/skills/architecture-patterns/SKILL.md
- @.agents/skills/fastapi-templates/SKILL.md
- @.agents/skills/frontend-patterns/SKILL.md
